        "value": "Empty living room/dining room in an apartment in a 1920s apartment house, Los Angeles, California. The art deco ceiling moldings remain. The brick wall was exposed during a recent renovation; the plaster wall was torn off. The flooring is new. A Murphy bed was once behind the door on the left, but now the narrow space is used for shelving. Venetian window blinds.I processed this image in Adobe Photoshop Elements using the Poster Edges filter.",
